ata-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">r</mi></mrow><mo>\u22c5</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">\u27e8</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>\u2212</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">\u27e9</mo></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo>\u2212</mo><mn>19</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Now, to obtain the Cartesian equation of the plane, we substitute <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"64\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D42B TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c27E8\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D466 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D467 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c27E9\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">r</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">\u27e8</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">\u27e9</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> into the equation above. Hence,</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"65\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\"